## API Overview

The BleX backend provides a FastAPI-based REST API at `backend/asset_api/` with the following routers:

### API Base URL
**Development**: `http://localhost:8000`  
**Production**: `https://api.blex.example.com`

### Router Structure
```
/health                          # System health check
/api/asset/movement              # Movement events (POST)
/api/assets/*                    # Asset CRUD
/api/zones/*                     # Zone CRUD + scanner assignments
/api/scanners/*                  # Scanner CRUD
/api/runtime/*                   # Master/Scanner registration + long-polling
/api/health/*                    # Bulk health updates
```

