## Performance Characteristics

### Latency Breakdown
| Stage | Latency | Notes |
|-------|---------|-------|
| BLE Scan | 10-100ms | Per beacon detection |
| MQTT Publish | 5-20ms | Scanner → Broker |
| Broker Routing | 1-5ms | Internal routing |
| Validation | 1-2ms | Schema check |
| Zone Detection | 2-5ms | RSSI comparison |
| Batch Aggregation | 100-5000ms | Configurable interval |
| Cloud Forward | 100-500ms | WSS to backend |
| **Total (Local)** | **120ms-5.2s** | Depends on batch interval |
| **Total (Cloud)** | **220ms-5.7s** | Includes backend write |

### Throughput
- **Per Scanner**: 5-50 beacons/sec (depends on beacon density)
- **Per Tablet**: 500-1500 msgs/sec (aggregate from all scanners)
- **Backend API**: 500-800 req/sec per instance

### Scalability
- **Beacons**: Unlimited (database constrained, not app)
- **Scanners**: 50+ per tablet (MQTT connection limit)
- **Tablets**: 1-100+ (with backend aggregation)
- **Sites**: Unlimited (cloud backend model)

