## Deployment Models

### Model 1: Standalone (No Backend)
- Android app only
- All data stored locally (SQLite)
- Good for: Small sites, POCs, demos

### Model 2: Local Backend
- Android app + backend on local network
- PostgreSQL on NAS or server
- Good for: Single facility, security-sensitive

### Model 3: Cloud Backend
- Android app + backend on AWS/Azure/GCP
- Multiple sites report to central server
- Good for: Multi-site enterprises

### Model 4: Hybrid
- Local MQTT + cache
- Periodic sync to cloud
- Good for: Unreliable internet, remote sites

