## Security Model
- **MQTT Auth**: Username/password (configurable)
- **TLS**: Optional for local, required for cloud
- **API Auth**: Bearer tokens (JWT planned)
- **Provisioning**: HTTP (not HTTPS) on setup hotspot only
- **Data**: No PII stored (only MAC addresses)

