## 🐛 Known Bugs

### Android App
- [ ] **BLE Scan Stops After 30 Min**: Android sometimes kills scan (workaround: periodic restart)
- [ ] **MQTT Status UI Bug**: Shows "Connected" briefly during reconnect (fix: better state machine)
- [ ] **Logs Screen Freeze**: LazyColumn performance issue with 1000+ entries (fix: limit to 500, paginate)

### Backend API
- [ ] **Movement Endpoint 500 Error**: Invalid timestamp returns 500 instead of 400 (fix: exception handling)
- [ ] **Duplicate MAC Error**: Unique constraint violated (fix: `ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE`)

### Scanners
- [ ] **Pi WiFi Loss**: Scanner loses WiFi after 24 hours (fix: periodic NetworkManager restart)
- [ ] **ESP32 Random Reboots**: Watchdog timeout? (fix: increase watchdog timer, add feed() calls)

